@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Child learner domain | identity mechanism remains open
class ChildProfile {
 learnerId
 nickname
 ageBand: 10-14
 avatarId
 appearanceId
 colorId
 badgeId
}
class AccessIdentity {
 identityId
 accessMethod: TBD
 recoveryPolicy: TBD
}
class DeviceSession {
 sessionId
 expiresAt
 revokedAt: optional
}
class LearningAttempt {
 attemptId
 revisionId
 currentStepId
 latestSequence
 status
}
class StepCompletion {
 stepId
 completedAt
}
class ProgressReceipt {
 eventId
 payloadDigest
 committedAt
}
class CompletionRecord {
 revisionId
 completedAt
}
ChildProfile "1" -- "1" AccessIdentity : scoped access
AccessIdentity "1" -- "0..*" DeviceSession
ChildProfile "1" -- "0..*" LearningAttempt
LearningAttempt "1" *-- "0..*" StepCompletion
LearningAttempt "1" *-- "0..*" ProgressReceipt
LearningAttempt "1" *-- "0..1" CompletionRecord
note bottom of AccessIdentity
Guest/device versus account is undecided.
No companion account or family owner.
Recovery mechanism requires a decision.
end note
note bottom of LearningAttempt
Bound to one content revision.
Completed steps persist; resume cursor may move.
No raw reflection payload in progress.
end note
@enduml
